+The toolbar has sections (Edit, Map, Display, Flight plan, Charts, Extra layers, Export/import, Print, Settings) — see [Toolbar](Toolbar). On a computer it is a menu bar along the top; on a phone or a tablet it is the bottom deck's **Menu** sheet ([Phone Layout](Phone-Layout)). Behaviour:
 
